'''Silkbreeze''' is a {{Rarity|l|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]].

== Spawning ==
'''Silkbreeze''' can be fished up from water on [[Torrhus Canyon]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level XV (15)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Silkbreeze''' is {{Green|100}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|1%|1|100|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

